abstract: "Turn business corrections into specialized local AI models. LLM Feedback Fine-Tuning Pipeline is a local-first system for reviewing human corrections, generating reproducible dataset snapshots, training compact MLX adapters on Apple Silicon, measuring paired regressions against frozen holdouts, and gating deployment."
